   "source": [
    "# Basic Import"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "4d605a39",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "url = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/datasciencedojo/datasets/master/titanic.csv\"\n",
    "\n",
    "df = pd.read_csv(url)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1a8a4253",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "There is no single right answer. The strategy depends on the column, the percentage missing, and what you plan to do with the data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7a39575a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# STRATEGY 1: DROP the column"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "932b1187",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Use when: too much data is missing to be useful (>50% missing as a rule of thumb)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "ec51b3de",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df.drop(columns = [\"Cabin\"] , inplace=True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8b6926e8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Cabin has 77% missing — filling it would be inventing data\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "720a93ca",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "inplace=True modifies df directly"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ab846788",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Without it: df = df.drop(columns=[\"Cabin\"])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "97405449",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# STRATEGY 2: DROP rows \n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8d8fdef4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Use when: very few rows are missing and you can afford to lose them"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "c531da5b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df.dropna(subset=[\"Embarked\"] , inplace=True)"
   ]
  },
